  <item>
    <title>我的影视圈朋友 | 冯小刚的副导演迟有志</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66dad545bfd7110df4b931cc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66dad545bfd7110df4b931cc</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 06 Sep 2024 10:11:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>迟有志，制片人、导演。</span></p><span></span><p><span>代表作：《一地鸡毛》、《月亮背面》、《贫嘴张大民的幸福生活》等。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>冯小刚</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="49">00:49</a> 从美术、《编辑部的故事》编剧、《北京人在纽约》联合导演、第一次独立导演《一地鸡毛》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="148">02:28</a> 迟老师《一地鸡毛》给冯小刚当副导演</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="404">06:44</a> 陈道明不会塑造人物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="515">08:35</a> 一点都不放松对艺术的追求</span></p><span></span><p><span>天天自己粗剪，一晚上不睡觉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="675">11:15</a> 不是胡同串子，但是苦出身</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="717">11:57</a> 巴结郑晓龙给自己创造机会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="790">13:10</a> 性情、幽默</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="850">14:10</a> 迟老师给《大腕》当策划，徐帆说别糟蹋我们家小刚了。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>刘晓庆</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="929">15:29</a> 义气。导演在场的情况下先和剧务握手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1071">17:51</a> 答应的待遇没完全达到也不计较</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1155">19:15</a> 一出去就能围几百人</span></p><span></span><h2><span>《贫嘴张大民的幸福生活》的拍摄经过</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1306">21:46</a> 梁冠华是不二人选</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1381">23:01</a> 和沈好放都是“容嬷嬷”的“儿子”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1473">24:33</a> 如日中天的刘恒亲自写剧本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1567">26:07</a> 沈好放的前妻是《乌龙山剿匪记》的导演</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1699">28:19</a> 沈好放要用朱媛媛，迟老师不同意，结果和朱媛媛弄得鼻子不是鼻子</span></p><span></span><h2><span>《月亮背面》</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1823">30:23</a> 冯小刚为了和迟老师合作，把头一集的拍摄地临时改到了迟老师正在度假的呼伦贝尔</span></p><span></span><h2><span>《情殇》</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1925">32:05</a> 刘小宁也在。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>副导演和制片主任都是做什么的</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1944">32:24</a> 副导演就是一催巴儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2042">34:02</a> 副导演把一切菜准备好导演上去一炒就行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2140">35:40</a> 制片主任管预算、管场景、给园林局磕头、管吃管住</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2226">37:06</a> 制片人不懂业务可以，制片主任不懂业务不可以</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2268">37:48</a> 导演相当于总工程师，制片主任相当于厂长</span></p><span></span><h2><span>《瑞雪飘飘》</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2195">36:35</a> 丁志城不拍第二条</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2382">39:42</a> 把丁志城开了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2435">40:35</a> 徐涛：哥，我老火不了，就想演一部戏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a> 对丁志城说：你要少退一分钱我就诉你</span></p><span></span><h2><span>冯远征</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2579">42:59</a> 和梁丹妮在我车前一通热吻</span></p><span></span><h2><span>付彪</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2680">44:40</a> 我在你们单位都是龙套啊，你得帮我找一好戏</span></p><span></span><h2><span>迟老师老帅哥</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2735">45:35</a> 锻炼身体，心梗都好了</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lq4KCmqEaFNAxHqSG3-ZPOX0JyHK.m4a" length="45447146" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:46:47</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhyMSfmiWTrhP3fRVVqSZPVUUUnY.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
