  <item>
    <title>凡妮莎·柯比：白寡妇的N种面孔</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d8d09dee04007d88365031</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d8d09dee04007d88365031</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 04 Sep 2024 21:26:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> “白寡妇” Vanessa Kirby 简介</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. 威尼斯影后</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. 英国学院奖最佳女配</span></p><span></span><p><span>3. 奥斯卡最佳女主提名</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="136">02:16</a> 话剧《朱莉小姐》</span></p><span></span><p><span>男仆：我要奋斗……</span></p><span></span><p><span>女主：然后呢？成为我？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="294">04:54</a> 《碟中谍》</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>悬念、反转、最后一分钟营救用到死</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>想起下部女主还是她就眼前一黑</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>动作奇观、世界奇观、科技奇观、权力奇观讲的都是空间</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="856">14:16</a> 《女人的碎片》</span></p><span></span><p><span>威尼斯主竞赛入围影片、影后，奥斯卡女主提名，英国学院奖女主提名</span></p><span></span><p><span>快来看啊，我在隐喻！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="967">16:07</a> 《王冠》</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>华丽而空洞的王权，华丽又破败的王权</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>玛格丽特就是作</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1513">25:13</a> 《打开心世界》</span></p><span></span><p><span>你俩到底谁主动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2138">35:38</a> 《拿破仑》</span></p><span></span><p><span>不要调情了，仗都来不及打了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2211">36:51</a> 《困在心绪里的儿子》</span></p><span></span><p><span>每个表情都是完美的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2306">38:26</a> 《琼斯先生》</span></p><span></span><p><span>原来你和男主拿个口琴一样的东西是为了干这个</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2453">40:53</a> 《意学研究》</span></p><span></span><p><span>360度无死角美颜街拍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2502">41:42</a> 《国家公园：野生动物王国》</span></p><span></span><p><span>和中国合作才意识到你是外国人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2598">43:18</a> 名字</span></p><span></span><p><span>向碟中谍第一部的女演员致敬</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2617">43:37</a> 长相</span></p><span></span><p><span>过于立体了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2654">44:14</a> 话剧演员</span></p><span></span><p><span>我是演莎士比亚、契诃夫的演员</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2708">45:08</a> 表演前的功课</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>看所有的档案、读所有的书、接触你能接触的人、听你听的歌</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>“我再也不要一个当演员的姐姐了！”</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2861">47:41</a> 肢体不协调</span></p><span></span><p><span>小鹿斑比不是说说而已</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2910">48:30</a> 不会打扮</span></p><span></span><p><span>梳梳头吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2916">48:36</a> 性格</span></p><span></span><p><span>有些人再耍宝你也不觉得她活泼开朗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3018">50:18</a> 家庭</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>泌尿外科医生的爸爸可以衍生八百个低俗笑话</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>今天凡妮莎提她妹了吗？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3147">52:27</a> 恋爱</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>不止一次和同组的男演员好上</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>我努力再努力才get了卡勒姆·特纳的性感</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3193">53:13</a> 下一个大魔王？</span></p><span></span><p><span>话剧演员+威尼斯影后+文艺片+商业片+大魔王亲自颁奖=下一个大魔王？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>勘误：</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>朱迪·科默！！我说错了！我也不知道半年后会对朱迪·科默上头！苍天饶过谁！</span></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>参考文献：</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>高燕：《当代空间的迷失与重绘：以&lt;碟中谍&gt;为中心》，《上海大学学报（社会科学版）》2020年11月。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>孟繁婷：《&lt;女人的碎片&gt;：从潜意识到显意识的女性独立意识觉醒》，《电影文学》2022年第7期。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>阮宋佳：《电视剧类型化趋势下的大女主类型角色创作研究》，上海戏剧学院2019年硕士学位论文。</span></blockquote>]]></description>
